n} is {$a->leftlabel}";s:15:"leftpartdefault";s:33:"{$a->min} is minimum slider range";s:15:"managequestions";s:12:"管理問題";s:20:"managequestions_help";s:96:"在編輯問題頁面中的管理問題章節，您可以在問卷報告中進行多個操作。";s:20:"managequestions_link";s:44:"mod/questionnaire/questions#Manage_questions";s:9:"mandatory";s:53:"Mandatory - All these dependencies must be fulfilled.";s:16:"maxdigitsallowed";s:21:"最多允許的數字";s:21:"maxdigitsallowed_help";s:116:"透過使用最多允許的數字及Nb的小數點參數，您可以指明小數點的長度及需要的小數位。";s:21:"maxdigitsallowed_link";s:35:"mod/questionnaire/questions#Numeric";s:18:"maxforcedresponses";s:21:"強制回答的上限";s:23:"maxforcedresponses_help";s:642:"Use these parameters to force respondent to tick a minimum of **Min.** boxes and a maximum of **Max.** check boxes. To
